Strong winds, right?{be01}
It represents the strength of us
and our Gym Leader!{be01}
This is a Pokémon Gym! Let's have
us a Pokémon battle!{be01}

I'll give you some advice.{be01}
If the floor is colored differently and
you're surrounded by walls, you probably{be00}
won't get blown away by the wind.
